=== Replica host pin ===
  GIT_SYNC_REPLICA_HOST=replica.example.net:443 (from this process's environment)
  The connector pushes only to this host and rejects any configuration naming another.

=== Configured git-sync providers ===
  (none)

=== Repository sync state ===
  No finished attempt recorded in the directory this command resolved. If the connector has run, check that GIT_SYNC_MIRRORS_DIR (or GIT_SYNC_CONFIG_FILE) matches its environment.

Enrollment status and failure reasons are visible in the Memento portal.
